race: the PC awake, on USB: LEDs on; shown lit 1, wanted 1, idle 0
race: -- a key (the L of Win+L), then the PC locks: away lands before the key's 50 ms check
race: away, after the key's check: LEDs off; shown lit 0, wanted 1, idle 1
race: away, past the 10 s save delay: LEDs off; shown lit 0, wanted 1, idle 1
race: -- the PC unlocks: back with the wake lights it again
race: back: LEDs on; shown lit 1, wanted 1, idle 0
race: -- the user's own off and on still count
race: the user's off: LEDs off; shown lit 0, wanted 0, idle 0
race: the user's on: LEDs on; shown lit 1, wanted 1, idle 0
race: -- the user's off, then away before its check: still the user's
race: away after the user's off: LEDs off; shown lit 0, wanted 0, idle 1
race: back after the user's off: LEDs off; shown lit 0, wanted 0, idle 0
race: the user's on again: LEDs on; shown lit 1, wanted 1, idle 0
race: -- done
